        "reading": {
          "text": "This table represents accurately recorded planetary positions made before the telescope. A later instrument does not make careful earlier observations valueless. A model must answer positional discrepancies as well as familiar periodic returns.",
          "attribution": "Historical teaching representation, not copied numerical data from Tycho."
        }
